Run.Description ARPES spectral function of pristine graphene
Run.Prefix generate

Run.TypeOfSystem Graphene
TB.Hopping 3.1

Structure.LatticeParameter 2.46
Structure.CellSize 1
Structure.SuperCell 1

Kubo.Calc .false.
Diag.Calc .true.
Calculate.Spectral .true.

# Photoemission matrix element of Wei and Ku, Phys. Rev. B 95, 085420 (2017), and
# a Gaussian of width Kubo.Epsilon (in units of g0) instead of the default energy bin
# of Spectral.energyGridResolution.
Spectral.WeiKu .true.
Spectral.UseGaussianBroadening .true.
Kubo.Epsilon 0.02

Spectral.NumPoints 20
&begin Spectral.Path 4
2/3  1/3  0.0   # K
0.0  0.0  0.0   # Gamma
0.5  0.0  0.0   # M
2/3  1/3  0.0   # K'
&end Spectral.Path

# Spectral.Emin and Spectral.Emax are in units of g0: 10.5/3.1 * 3.1 eV = 10.5 eV here, and the
# 161 points are then 0.13125 eV apart. The bands reach +-3*g0 = +-9.3 eV at Gamma.
Kubo.NumberofEnergyPoints 161
Spectral.Emin 0-10.5/3.1
Spectral.Emax 10.5/3.1

TB.NeighLevels 1
Neigh.CompareAll .true.
Stack.NonBulkSmall .true.

Output.WriteDataFiles .false.
WritePos .false.
